                                                "sense_id": "06ccc995-3e7a-3fe9-bc5f-62e2a77aaa3f",
                                                "text": "the temple of the Gods […] / Whom all the people decke with girlands greene, / And honour in their festiuall resort […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
